// @function Computes Mars's heliocentric radius (distance from Sun) using VSOP87 theory.
// @param t (float) Julian millennia from J2000.0 (use get_julian_millennia(time)).
// @returns (float) Heliocentric radius in astronomical units (AU). Typical range is 1.38-1.67 AU.
mar_get_helio_radius(float t) =>
    array<vsop_term> R0 = array.new<vsop_term>()
